; One variable: the sky's `background_energy_multiplier`, 2, with the sky as the only light. A
; surface reads the radiance at the multiplier the bake holds and at it again (`render_scene_data_rd.cpp:169`,
; `scene_forward_clustered.glsl:1732`, `:1756`), so the ambient draws at four times the sky. No other
; scene lights with the sky alone above multiplier 1, so none shows a regression in it.

